      "instance_name": "group_of_people",
      "label": "people",
      "description": "A group of Black youth, likely teenagers or young adults, are gathered together. They are dressed in white shirts and appear to be participating in a peaceful protest or civil rights demonstration. Their expressions range from serious to smiling, conveying a sense of unity and purpose. The group is diverse in gender and facial features, representing a collective identity.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
